.el .ds Aq '
.TH ifg-search 1  "ifg-search 0.8.1" 
.SH NAME
ifg\-search \- Search repositories, issues and wiki pages
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg search\fR [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search repositories, issues and wiki pages
.PP
`\-\-type` narrows to repo/issue/wiki (default: all). The server understands qualifiers such as `repo:owner/name` and `state:open` in the query text.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<SEARCH_TYPE>\fR [default: all]
all / repo / issue / wiki
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR
Stop after N hits (default 30)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
Query text (the server understands repo:/state: qualifiers)
.SH VERSION
v0.8.1
